# Naming Conventions

| Type | Style | Example |
|------|-------|---------|
| Class, Interface, Record | PascalCase | `UserService`, `IRepository` |
| Method, Property | PascalCase | `GetUserById`, `FirstName` |
| Private field | _camelCase | `_userRepository` |
| Local variable, Parameter | camelCase | `userId`, `firstName` |
| Constant | PascalCase | `MaxRetryCount` |
| Interface | Prefix `I` | `IUserService` |
| Generic Type Parameter | Prefix `T` | `TEntity`, `TResult` |
| Async Method | Suffix `Async` | `GetUserAsync` |
| Enum | PascalCase singular | `UserStatus` not `UserStatuses` |
